    "name": "Find Smallest Prime Factor of a Number in O(sqrt n)",
    "code": "# Python3 program to find the smallest\n# prime factor of a number using\n# trial division up to sqrt(n)\nimport math\n\ndef smallest_prime_factor(n):\n    if n % 2 == 0:\n        return 2\n\n    # Only odd candidates up to sqrt(n)\n    # can be the smallest prime factor\n    i = 3\n    while i <= int(math.sqrt(n)):\n        if n % i == 0:\n            return i\n        i += 2\n\n    return n\n\n\n# Driver code\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    n = 91\n    print(smallest_prime_factor(n))\n",
